|large=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}

==Mechanics==
* '''Shock effect''': Vessel of Vinktar applies a base 10% effect shock to nearby enemies during flask effect. This shock is scaled by the user's modifiers to effect of shock and lightning ailments. Similarly, the 50% shock on the user is also scaled by the user's effect of shock and lightning ailments, additive with {{c|mod|#% reduced Effect of Shock on you}}. Neither shocks are scaled by flask effect.
* '''Shock Radius''': Enemies within approximately 30 [[unit]]s of the user will be [[shock]]ed as long as the flask is active. However, enemies will not remain shocked if they move out of range.
* '''Self-shock''': The self-shock cannot be proliferated or reflected to enemies (e.g. via {{il|Esh's Visage}}).
* '''Flask Stacking:''' When using several different Vessel of Vinktar variants simultaneously, each of their distinct modifiers will apply, but any shared modifiers will not.

{{Item acquisition|page=Vessel of Vinktar (Lightning Penetration)}}

Notably, the shock proliferation variant ({{il|page=Vessel of Vinktar (Shock Effect and Proliferation)}}) appears to be exclusive to Tier 12+ {{il|The Vinktar Square}} maps only, while the other four variants can drop at any tier. It is also noticably rarer than the other variants, at an estimated 5% drop rate compared to approximately 24% drop rate for the other variants.<ref>[[Prohibited Library (community)|Prohibited Library]] <sup>(requires membership to view)</sup> - https://discord.com/channels/991073626721763429/991092751502278736/1475764528074457202</ref>

==Version history==
